       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI58102.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI58102.                                         *
      *                                                                *
      *     Alterar para reconciliado                                  *
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.

       DATA DIVISION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI58102         '.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5808 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5810.
       COPY SWCV5811.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.

       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY AQCW0005.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *01  SW-SWITCH.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT5808                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5808'.
           05 CON-SWVT7204                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.
           05 CON-DEBITO                   PIC  X(01) VALUE 'D'.
           05 CON-RC                       PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RC'.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-MONTANTE                  PIC  ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ9,99.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI58102'.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2                     *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI58102         '.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0004.

            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5810-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5810-ASE               TO SWCV5811-ASE.

       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5810-IDRECON           TO SWCV5811-IDRECON.

           PERFORM 2100-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-APRESENTA-DADOS
                 THRU 2200-APRESENTA-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-VALIDACOES
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-VALIDACOES.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2200-APRESENTA-DADOS
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-APRESENTA-DADOS.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-APRESENTA-DADOS'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5810-IDRECON           TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT IDRECONC
                   , MRDATL
                   , MRVLR
                   , MRNOPR
                   , MRNORD
                   , CCODEST
                   , CNATREC
                   , CINTERV
                   , CUSERIDINT
                   , CCODMSG
                   , DATVAL
                   , COSN
                   , COSNC
                   , MRDMOV
               INTO
                     :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDATL
                   , :SWCD7204-MRVLR
                   , :SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                   , :SWCD7204-MRNORD
                   , :SWCD7204-CCODEST
                   , :SWCD7204-CNATREC
                   , :SWCD7204-CINTERV
                   , :SWCD7204-CUSERIDINT
                   , :SWCD7204-CCODMSG
                   , :SWCD7204-DATVAL
                   , :SWCD7204-COSN
                   , :SWCD7204-COSNC
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDMOV
               FROM SWVT7204
              WHERE IDRECONC = :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
              FETCH FIRST ROW ONLY
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE SWCD7204-IDRECONC       TO SWCV5811-IDRECON
              MOVE SWCD7204-MRDATL         TO AQCW0005-DT98
              PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                 THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
              MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10          TO SWCV5811-MRDATL
              MOVE SWCD7204-MRDMOV         TO SWCV5811-GDESC
              MOVE SWCD7204-MRVLR          TO WS-MONTANTE
              IF SWCD7204-MRVLR LESS THAN ZEROES
                 MOVE WS-MONTANTE          TO SWCV5811-MDEBITO
              ELSE
                 MOVE WS-MONTANTE          TO SWCV5811-MCREDITO
              END-IF
              MOVE SWCD7204-MRNOPR         TO SWCV5811-MRNOPR
              MOVE SWCD7204-MRNORD         TO SWCV5811-MRNORD
              MOVE SWCD7204-CCODEST        TO SWCV5811-IRECONC
              MOVE SWCD7204-CNATREC        TO SWCV5811-ITIPORECONC
              MOVE SWCD7204-CINTERV        TO SWCV5811-CINTERV
              MOVE SWCD7204-CUSERIDINT     TO SWCV5811-GUSERNAME
           END-IF.

           IF SWCD7204-CCODEST EQUAL CON-RC
              MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO  TO SWCV5811-IDRECON-S
              MOVE SWCK0001-NOPR-N-EXISTS  TO SWCV5811-IDRECON-MSG
              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC         TO SWCV5811-IDRECON-CAPLIC
           END-IF.

       2200-APRESENTA-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5811-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5811-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5811-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
      *
       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY ARCR0039.
           COPY AQCP0005.
